MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

```

bars <- nodebar(trait, cols=1:3, position='dodge',color=c('blue','red','green'))

bars <- lapply(bars, function(x) x + ylim(0, 100)) ## force in same scale

bartree <- inset(tr2, bars, x='branch',width=.06, height=0.3,hjust=0)
bartree

```

It is easy to force the bars in the same scale

